  "goodToKnow": "Die Revolution is a revolution: die Französische Revolution, die industrielle Revolution. Germany's own Friedliche Revolution in autumn 1989 brought down the East German regime without bloodshed, with candles and the chant Wir sind das Volk. The failed revolution of 1848 is also important in German history. Revolutionär means revolutionary. Words ending in -tion are feminine."
